; PLEASE KEEP THE MINGW/COREDLL*.DEF AND W32API/LIBCE/COREDLL*.DEF
; FILES IN SYNC.
; COREDLL import surface for Windows Embedded Compact 2013 (arm-wince-mingw32ce)
; Base: Windows Embedded Compact 2013 shared source,
; private/winceos/COREOS/core/dll/core_common.def (+ corelib1.def).
; Parsing policy: ARM retail (x86/PPC/MIPS/SH and DEBUG blocks excluded),
; every @CESYSGEN branch included (superset surface: individual devices
; export only what their OS image was built with), and NONAME
; (ordinal-only) exports omitted -- they cannot be resolved by a
; name-based import library.
; ; 1792 name exports.

